# NVIDIA N1x additions, composed after omarchy-base.packages and
# omarchy-aarch64.packages (omarchy-pkg-defaults aarch64-n1x): what every N1x
# laptop runs, which install/hardware/n1x.sh also installs. Board-specific
# packages (the ASUS ProArt P14's amplifier firmware) stay with their model's
# hardware setup.
linux-omarchy-n1x
linux-omarchy-n1x-headers
# Release firmware (1.0 and later) drives the panel from the GPU.
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
libva-nvidia-driver
# omarchy-n1x-probe uses lspci.
pciutils
